Response data: ```python
df1_count = df1['dis'].str.strip().value_counts().rename_axis('行政區').reset_index(name='新北市充電站數量')
df2_count = df2['行政區'].str.strip().value_counts().rename_axis('行政區').reset_index(name='台北市充電站數量')
result = pd.merge(df1_count, df2_count, on='行政區', how='outer').fillna(0)
result['新北市充電站數量'] = result['新北市充電站數量'].astype(int)
result['台北市充電站數量'] = result['台北市充電站數量'].astype(int)
result['充電站總數量'] = result['新北市充電站數量'] + result['台北市充電站數量']
result = result.sort_values('充電站總數量', ascending=False).reset_index(drop=True)
```
